[
  {
    "text": "独自出门，去见一位朋友。",
    "startMs": 650,
    "endMs": 3245,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "对聋人和重听人士，重要的环境提醒，也应有触觉的入口。",
    "startMs": 3352,
    "endMs": 8176,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "SoundBridge，让重要的提醒被感知。",
    "startMs": 8283,
    "endMs": 11270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "共享步道上，身后传来车铃。",
    "startMs": 12650,
    "endMs": 15604,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "拟议系统识别声音类别，触发三次短振，并显示车铃图标和文字。",
    "startMs": 15714,
    "endMs": 21636,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "提醒提供线索，接下来，观察周围。",
    "startMs": 21745,
    "endMs": 25270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "她停在步道一侧，转头确认骑行者的位置。",
    "startMs": 26650,
    "endMs": 30516,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "确认空间后，让对方通过，再继续自己的行程。",
    "startMs": 30625,
    "endMs": 34806,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "选择，由她自己作出。",
    "startMs": 34915,
    "endMs": 37270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "麦克风采集短时声音，转换为频谱特征。",
    "startMs": 38650,
    "endMs": 42104,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "拟议的本地模型，识别车铃、鸣笛和门铃。",
    "startMs": 42204,
    "endMs": 45658,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "置信度筛选、连续确认和重复抑制，再决定是否提醒。",
    "startMs": 45759,
    "endMs": 50195,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "真实环境中的漏报和误报，仍需验证。",
    "startMs": 50295,
    "endMs": 53270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "声音类别映射到振动节奏，再驱动触觉马达。",
    "startMs": 54650,
    "endMs": 58407,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "门铃用两组双击，车铃和鸣笛用三次短振。",
    "startMs": 58511,
    "endMs": 62307,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "配合图标与文字，不只依赖颜色。",
    "startMs": 62412,
    "endMs": 65270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "来向估计，需要多麦克风硬件和校准。",
    "startMs": 66650,
    "endMs": 69798,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "比较声音到达的时间差，估计相对手表的大致来向。",
    "startMs": 69898,
    "endMs": 73741,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "无法可靠判断时，明确显示方向不确定。",
    "startMs": 73842,
    "endMs": 77259,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "它不能代替观察，也不保证避开危险。",
    "startMs": 77359,
    "endMs": 80270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "拟议状态设计，让暂停、低电量和感知故障清晰可见。",
    "startMs": 81650,
    "endMs": 85918,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "暂停或故障时，明确告知无法提供提醒。",
    "startMs": 86022,
    "endMs": 89363,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "没有收到提醒，不代表周围没有风险。",
    "startMs": 89467,
    "endMs": 92270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "选择关注的声音，试一试不同的振动强度。",
    "startMs": 93650,
    "endMs": 97051,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "字号也能调整，偏好保存在本地。",
    "startMs": 97158,
    "endMs": 100143,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "与聋人和重听人士共同测试，让提示容易理解。",
    "startMs": 100249,
    "endMs": 104270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "同样的感知流程，也能用于居家门铃提示。",
    "startMs": 105650,
    "endMs": 109269,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "振动与文字提示有人来访，让你继续专注自己的生活。",
    "startMs": 109376,
    "endMs": 113903,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "何时回应，由你决定。",
    "startMs": 114010,
    "endMs": 116270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "居家关注门铃，户外关注车铃与鸣笛。",
    "startMs": 117650,
    "endMs": 121213,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "暂停会停止采集与提醒，并持续显示暂停状态。",
    "startMs": 121321,
    "endMs": 125717,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "准备好了，再恢复感知。",
    "startMs": 125825,
    "endMs": 128270,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
